                {"english": "The supreme foundational doctrine of his philosophy is the Unity of Knowledge and Action (Zhi Xing He Yi).", "chinese": "王阳明心学体系中贯穿始终的最硬核核心教义，正是彪炳史册的“知行合一”哲学大命题。"},
