                {"english": "Align your thoughts with deliberate action, listen to your intuitive conscience, and walk illuminated with inner peace.", "chinese": "以知促行、知行合一，静心聆听良知之声的召唤，你便能在浮躁喧嚣的红尘人世间步履从容、心安理得，走向光明坦荡！"}
